<view class="home-page">
  <view class="home-card">
    <view class="home-kicker">TUOTUZJU MINI PROGRAM</view>
    <view class="home-title">拓途浙享</view>
    <view class="home-desc">
      当前为微信小程序原生入口。若你能看到这一页，说明小程序编译和原生渲染正常，黑屏问题集中在 WebView 域名、证书或远程页面加载阶段。
    </view>
    <view class="home-origin">{{webOrigin}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="home-actions">
    <button class="bridge-button primary" bindtap="openEvents">打开活动聚合</button>
    <button class="bridge-button secondary" bindtap="openFallback">打开诊断页</button>
  </view>
</view>
